<h2>Frequently asked questions</h2>
<h3>Why did my battery quote change without notice?</h3>
<p>Most likely the material price moved, the quote expired, or the specification changed. Ask for the date, the material basis and the Incoterm behind the number; a quote without those cannot be compared.</p>
<h3>Should I buy when lithium prices are low?</h3>
<p>Not necessarily. Cell price is only one input; demand, certification and freight also move. Buy against a specification and a validated sample, not against a price forecast alone.</p>
